   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Pixelated Solar Facades</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Pixelated Solar Facades\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of parts 1 and 2 of the online aesthetic survey, using the paper's own screenshots of its survey questions: facade designs for apartment buildings in Trondheim, Norway, clad in coloured photovoltaic panels (FIPV) whose NCS colours are arranged as pixels. Participants answer the paper's background questions (attitude to PV on roofs and facades, PV knowledge, whether they are an architect, designer, planner, fine artist or a student of these, country of origin, country of residence, gender, age group, visit to Trondheim), then rate a colourless multi-story facade prototype (Q10) and the same prototype covered by pixelated reddish PV (Q11) on the paper's 5-level scale from very good to very poor, then choose the facade they like best among one pixelated and two non-pixelated PV designs for the multi-story prototype (Q12) and for the high-rise prototype (Q15). They can leave a comment at the end. Rebuilt from Xiang, Matusiak, Royset & Kolas (2021), Pixelization approach for facade integrated coloured photovoltaics - with architectural proposals in city context of Trondheim, Norway, Solar Energy 224: 1222-1246, Section 6, with images from its Figs. 37-40 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; figures unchanged, the question text and answer buttons printed in each screenshot are hidden by cropping the view and shown as live text and buttons instead). The question wording is the paper's. Image ids: ms_prototype and ms_pixelated (answer aesthetic, 1 = very poor to 5 = very good, as in the paper's coding), ms_alternatives and hr_alternatives (answer preferred, A, B or C; the pixelated designs are B in Q12 and A in Q15, per Table 6). Analysis as in the paper: paired t-test of Q10 against Q11, share choosing each design in Q12 and Q15, and means for experts (yes to Q3) against laypersons. The paper (309 participants from many countries, 42% experts) found the pixelated design raised the mean aesthetic rating of the multi-story prototype from 3.28 to 3.64, and the pixelated designs were the most preferred alternatives for both prototypes. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper's high-rise rating questions (Q13, Q14) are left out because their images are not printed, and part 3 (pixelated proposals for real buildings, Q16-Q20) is left out because its photographs of Trondheim are not clearly the authors' own (Fig. 35, used in Q20, is credited to archdaily.com); (2) the optional e-mail question (Q9) is left out; (3) the gender options are ours because the paper does not list them; (4) the question wording follows the paper's screenshots and its list in Section 6, and the introduction and consent text are ours.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"survey\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"part1\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"q1_pv_attitude\",\n      \"title\": \"What do you think about application of PVs on building roofs and facades?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"5\",\n        \"text\": \"Very supportive\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"4\",\n        \"text\": \"Supportive\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"3\",\n        \"text\": \"Neutral\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"2\",\n        \"text\": \"Against\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1\",\n        \"text\": \"Very against\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"q2_pv_knowledge\",\n      \"title\": \"How do you evaluate your knowledge and/or experience with photovoltaics?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"5\",\n        \"text\": \"Rich\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"4\",\n        \"text\": \"Good\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"3\",\n        \"text\": \"Some\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"2\",\n        \"text\": \"Little\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1\",\n        \"text\": \"No experience\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"q3_expert\",\n      \"title\": \"Are you an architect/ designer /urban planner /fine artist/ or a student of those professions?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"q4_origin\",\n      \"title\": \"What is your country of origin?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"q5_residence\",\n      \"title\": \"In which country have you lived in the last two years?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"q6_gender\",\n      \"title\": \"What is your gender?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other or prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"q7_age\",\n      \"title\": \"And your age?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"lt30\",\n        \"text\": \"Less than 30\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"30to50\",\n        \"text\": \"30-50\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"gt50\",\n        \"text\": \"More than 50\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"q8_trondheim\",\n      \"title\": \"Have you been to Trondheim city center in the last ten years?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"part2\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"aesthetic\",\n      \"title\": \"How do you evaluate its overall aesthetics?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"5\",\n        \"text\": \"Very good\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"4\",\n        \"text\": \"Good\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"3\",\n        \"text\": \"Fair\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"2\",\n        \"text\": \"Poor\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1\",\n        \"text\": \"Very poor\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"preferred\",\n      \"title\": \"Which facade do you like best?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"A\",\n        \"text\": \"A\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"B\",\n        \"text\": \"B\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C\",\n        \"text\": \"C\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"comment\",\n      \"name\": \"comments\",\n      \"title\": \"Any comments? (optional)\",\n      \"isRequired\": false\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"pv-original\">{\"source\": \"Xiang, Matusiak, Royset & Kolas (2021) Solar Energy 224: 1222-1246\", \"n\": 309, \"expertShare\": 0.42, \"steps\": [{\"id\": \"ms_prototype\", \"q\": \"aesthetic\", \"no\": \"10\", \"text\": \"Here is a prototype of a facade geometry for a multi-story house, how do you evaluate its overall aesthetics?\", \"crop\": [110, 805], \"w\": 980}, {\"id\": \"ms_pixelated\", \"q\": \"aesthetic\", \"no\": \"11\", \"text\": \"The prototype has been covered by coloured photovoltaics with slightly varied nuances, how do you evaluate its overall aesthetic?\", \"crop\": [105, 790], \"w\": 980}, {\"id\": \"ms_alternatives\", \"q\": \"preferred\", \"no\": \"12\", \"text\": \"There are different alternatives, which facade do you like best?\", \"crop\": [80, 672], \"w\": 1476}, {\"id\": \"hr_alternatives\", \"q\": \"preferred\", \"no\": \"15\", \"text\": \"Which facade do you like best?\", \"crop\": [130, 866], \"w\": 1477}], \"result\": {\"q10_mean\": 3.278, \"q11_mean\": 3.638, \"pixelated\": \"Q12 B, Q15 A; most preferred in both\"}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1d1b;--muted:#5d5c57;--accent:#2b5d7a;--line:#dad8d2;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#dce9f1}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\n.fig{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}\n.fig .in{min-width:0;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto}.fig .in.wide{min-width:560px;max-width:none}\n.crop{overflow:hidden;position:relative}.crop img{position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\ntextarea,input[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;margin-top:6px}\n.qno{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\n.fig .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 0 6px}\n.hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}\n@media (min-width:700px){.hint{display:none}}\n.picks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\n.picks label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 6px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}\n.picks label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.picks input{display:none}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\n.q.miss,.picks.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;max-width:140px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Survey images and question wording: Xiang, Matusiak, Røyset &amp; Kolås (2021), Solar Energy 224: 1222–1246, Figs. 37–40 (doi:10.1016/j.solener.2021.06.079, CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; figures unchanged, cropped in view only).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='fipv-pixel:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('pv-original').textContent), STEPS=ORIG.steps;\n  var P1=['q1_pv_attitude','q2_pv_knowledge','q3_expert','q4_origin','q5_residence','q6_gender','q7_age','q8_trondheim'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',i:0};}\n  function chs(q){return (q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return typeof c==='string'?{value:c,text:c}:c;});}\n  function radios(n,no){var q=Q[n];return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+(no?'<span class=\"qno\">'+no+'. </span>':'')+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+chs(q).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function textq(n,no){return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b><span class=\"qno\">'+no+'. </span>'+esc(Q[n].title)+'</b><input type=\"text\" id=\"'+n+'\" maxlength=\"80\"></div>';}\n  function pick(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function bad(n,m){var el=app.querySelector('[data-q='+n+']');el.classList.add('miss');el.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});err(m||('Please answer: '+Q[n].title));}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Coloured solar panels on building facades</h1><p>This survey asks how you see facades covered by coloured solar panels (photovoltaics, PV) in Trondheim, Norway. First some questions about you, then four facade designs to evaluate. It takes about 4 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label></div><div class=\"card\">'+\n     radios('q1_pv_attitude',1)+radios('q2_pv_knowledge',2)+radios('q3_expert',3)+textq('q4_origin',4)+textq('q5_residence',5)+radios('q6_gender',6)+radios('q7_age',7)+radios('q8_trondheim',8)+\n     '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var vals={};\n      for(var k=0;k<P1.length;k++){var n=P1[k],v;\n        if(n==='q4_origin'||n==='q5_residence'){v=document.getElementById(n).value.trim();if(!v)return bad(n);}\n        else{v=pick(n);if(v==null)return bad(n);}\n        vals[n]=v;}\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)].concat(P1.map(function(n){return SPSite.answer(n,vals[n]);})),this,function(){st.step='steps';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function stepPage(){\n    var s=STEPS[st.i],f=files[s.id],h=s.crop[1]-s.crop[0],isPick=s.q==='preferred';\n    var pad=(h/s.w*100).toFixed(3),top=(-s.crop[0]/s.w*100).toFixed(3);\n    var ctl=isPick?'<div class=\"picks\" data-q=\"preferred\">'+['A','B','C'].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"preferred\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>'\n      :'<div data-q=\"aesthetic\" class=\"q\">'+chs(Q.aesthetic).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"aesthetic\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Design '+(st.i+1)+' of '+STEPS.length+'</div><h2><span class=\"qno\">'+s.no+'. </span>'+esc(s.text)+'</h2>'+\n     '<div class=\"fig\"><div class=\"in'+(isPick?' wide':'')+'\"><div class=\"crop\" style=\"padding-top:'+pad+'%\"><img alt=\"Facade design\" style=\"top:0;margin-top:'+top+'%\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div></div></div>'+(isPick?'<p class=\"hint\">Swipe sideways to see all three facades.</p>':'')+\n     '<div class=\"card\">'+ctl+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v=pick(s.q);if(v==null){var p=app.querySelector('[data-q]');p.classList.add('miss');return err(isPick?'Please pick A, B or C.':'Please choose one answer.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer(s.q,isPick?v:Number(v),{key:s.id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.i++;if(st.i>=STEPS.length)st.step='comments';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function comments(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>'+esc(Q.comments.title)+'</h2><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"q\" data-q=\"comments\"><textarea id=\"cm\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea></div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v=document.getElementById('cm').value.trim();\n      send(v?[SPSite.answer('comments',v)]:[],this,function(){st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st=fresh();save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&(e.target.closest('.picks')||e.target.closest('.q'));if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('change',clr);app.addEventListener('input',clr);\n  function route(){window.scrollTo(0,0);if(st.step==='steps')return stepPage();if(st.step==='comments')return comments();if(st.step==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','aesthetic','preferred','comments'].concat(P1).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('survey')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=STEPS.map(function(s){return s.id;}).filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.png) to the media folder \"survey\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.step)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
